# Deliberately tracked, not ignored: pins exact resolved component
# versions (including transitive deps like espressif/cmake_utilities)
# so a fresh CI checkout resolves the same known-working versions
# instead of re-querying the registry for "latest matching" and
# potentially hitting a newly-published component manifest with syntax
# PlatformIO's bundled idf-component-manager can't parse (confirmed the
# hard way in CI — see src/idf_component.yml's esp_lcd_st77916 comment
# for the same underlying parser limitation hitting a different
# dependency the first time).
# dependencies.lock

# build-time secrets — don't commit your real WiFi credentials
src/wifi_creds.h
